Blinkered word list for Bahasa Indonesia (id)
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-3.0

This file is generated. It is not a copy of any dictionary. It is the list of words that
appear in a frequency-ordered corpus of id AND are accepted by every validator
below, filtered to what the game can deal as tiles. Neither input is redistributed here.
Rebuild it with `pnpm dictionary build --language=id`.

Distributed under LGPL-3.0, which is the most restrictive of the terms below. See
PROVENANCE.md for what was relied on and why.

Ordering
  hermitdave/FrequencyWords, from the OpenSubtitles 2018 corpus via OPUS
  MIT

Validation
  hunspell `id_ID` (LGPL-3.0) — Hunspell Indonesian, Kamus Besar Bahasa Indonesia contributors

The full text of each licence is in ../licences/.
